  "name": "Slow Cooker Chicken Taco Soup",
  "subtitle": "A hearty bean-and-chicken soup with taco-seasoned vegetables",
  "description": "Canned beans, corn, tomatoes, vegetables, and chicken simmer together for a filling taco-inspired soup, finished with fresh toppings and crushed tortilla chips.",
